title: Quest3_Shopping_List
---
Your list is :"wine(vintage), steak, chocolate cake, and fresh grapes" find those around the grocery store and bring them to the cashier.
===

title: Quest3_Shopping_Wine
---
You're looking for a older aged wine instead of new age try to find something pre 2000
      <<if $Wineunder2000 == False>>
	<<jump Quest3_Wrong_wine>>
<<endif>>

<<if $Wineunder2000 == True>>
	<<jump Quest3_Shopping_Chocolate>>
<<endif>>

===

title: Quest3_Wrong_Wine
---
You selected a wine over the year 2000
===

title: Quest3_Shopping_Chocolate
